<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/ACTIVE> linkml:description "Someone has to take a deliberate step." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/ADJACENT> linkml:description "Only from something logically or physically nearby." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/ADJACENT_NETWORK> linkml:description "Only from a logically nearby network." , "Only from the same local network segment." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/AMBER> linkml:description "The supplier says the flaw matters soon." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/AND> linkml:description "All of the parts must hold." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/ATTACKED> linkml:description "Attacks have been reported, or tools for them are public." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/AUTOMATIC> linkml:description "The system recovers by itself." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/Automatable> a linkml:SlotDefinition ;
	linkml:annotations _:c14n183 ;
	linkml:description "Whether an attacker could automate every step of an attack across many targets." ;
	linkml:ifabsent "CvssV4Automatable(NOT_DEFINED)" ;
	linkml:range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CvssV4Automatable> .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CHANGED> linkml:description "The harm can reach something under another security authority." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CLEAR> linkml:description "The supplier sees little or no urgency." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/COMPLETE> linkml:description "All of it is lost." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CONCENTRATED> linkml:description "A single target holds a lot." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CONFIRMED> linkml:description "The flaw is shown beyond doubt, or the vendor accepts it." , "The vendor accepts it, or a working attack shows it." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CRITICAL> linkml:description "The highest rating." ;
	linkml:meaning "spdx_security:CvssSeverityType/critical"^^xsd:anyURI .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/CVE_RECORD> linkml:description "A document in the CVE Record Format." .
